[4.476001, "o", "# Enrichment API\r\n\r\nBase URL is provided by the `API_BASE` environment variable.\r\n\r\n## GET /enrich\r\n\r\nEnriches one record.\r\n\r\nQuery parameter:\r\n\r\n```text\r\nrecord_id\r\n```\r\n\r\nDocumented limit: 2 requests per second.\r\n\r\n## POST /batch_enrich\r\n\r\nEnriches multiple records in one request.\r\n\r\nJSON body:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"record_ids\": [1, 2, 3]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nMaximum batch size: 100.\r\n\r\n"]
[4.476172, "o", "Documented limit: 5 requests per second.\r\n"]
[4.476461, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[4.476543, "o", "root@bbc4aa9595a4:/app# "]
